---
source: crates/cli/tests/cli_output_snapshots.rs
expression: stdout
---
Safety and control commands

Usage: wheelctl safety [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  enable  Enable high torque mode
  stop    Emergency stop all devices
  status  Show safety status
  limit   Set torque limits
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json                 Output in JSON format for machine parsing
  -v, --verbose...           Verbose logging
      --no-mock              Fail if wheeld is unreachable instead of showing simulated data [env: WHEELCTL_NO_MOCK=1]
      --endpoint <ENDPOINT>  Service endpoint (for testing) [env: WHEELCTL_ENDPOINT=]
  -h, --help                 Print help
